{"3905590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chill Fox", "steam_appid": 3905590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/extras/3c0d99997f5b85f2d39448caeb8596ec.poster.avif?t=1763415142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/extras/3c0d99997f5b85f2d39448caeb8596ec.webm?t=1763415142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/extras/3c0d99997f5b85f2d39448caeb8596ec.mp4?t=1763415142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let’s take a break from AAA chaos, try this silly and quirky fox game instead!<br>  <br><strong>Chill Fox</strong> is a small, silly, and fun stealth game where you play as a clever fox with a <br>mission to steal chickens and eggs from a quiet countryside farm. There’s no timer, just <br>take your time, explore the beautiful surroundings, and enjoy the laid-back vibes.       <br>  <br>    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don’t let the calm fool you! Two guard dogs are always on the lookout. Stay sharp Fox!  <br>              </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten golden eggs are scattered across the area, each one is worth five hens. Find them all! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And whatever you do… don’t forget the elephant. He deserves his freedom too! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/extras/5ca84481297f2c38dbf3f2c06b9ffe3c.avif?t=1763415142\" width=600 height=350 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/extras/3c0d99997f5b85f2d39448caeb8596ec.poster.avif?t=1763415142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/extras/3c0d99997f5b85f2d39448caeb8596ec.webm?t=1763415142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/extras/3c0d99997f5b85f2d39448caeb8596ec.mp4?t=1763415142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let’s take a break from AAA chaos, try this silly and quirky fox game instead!<br>  <br><strong>Chill Fox</strong> is a small, silly, and fun stealth game where you play as a clever fox with a <br>mission to steal chickens and eggs from a quiet countryside farm. There’s no timer, just <br>take your time, explore the beautiful surroundings, and enjoy the laid-back vibes.       <br>  <br>    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don’t let the calm fool you! Two guard dogs are always on the lookout. Stay sharp Fox!  <br>              </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten golden eggs are scattered across the area, each one is worth five hens. Find them all! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And whatever you do… don’t forget the elephant. He deserves his freedom too! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/extras/5ca84481297f2c38dbf3f2c06b9ffe3c.avif?t=1763415142\" width=600 height=350 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Play as a fox, eat the chicken, get the egg. Smack humans, goats, crocodiles, and other animals with a rock. Ride an elephant and a rhino. Have fun!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Indo